{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "d/dx W(x) = 1/(exp(W(x))*(W(x) + 1))\n  holds for x > -1/e\n    at x = -1/e (an end of the domain) W(x) has an infinite one-sided slope\n    (points looked for in [-10, 10])\n  check: matches central differences at 104 points (max relative difference 1e-12)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "diff", "ucas": "diff W(x)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "diff", "vars": ["x"], "order": 1, "derivative": "1/(exp(W(x))*(W(x) + 1))"}, "notes": [], "conditions": ["x > -1/e"], "checks": [{"kind": "central_differences", "points": 104, "max_diff": 1.1666601116167713e-12, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "d/dx W(x) = 1/(exp(W(x))*(W(x) + 1))\n  holds for x > -1/e\n    at x = -1/e (an end of the domain) W(x) has an infinite one-sided slope\n    (points looked for in [-10, 10])\n  check: matches central differences at 104 points (max relative difference 1e-12)\n"}, "isError": false}}
