{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 7, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Maclaurin (Taylor at 0) series of sin(x) at x = 0, through order 7:\n  sin(x) = x - x^3/6 + x^5/120 - x^7/5040 + O(x^8)\n  as x -> 0; coefficients c_k = f^(k)(0)/k!: 0 1 0 -1/6 0 1/120 0 -1/5040\n  check: the coefficients agree with Taylor-jet arithmetic (long double) to 0\n  check: |f - P| = 2.76e-15 at x = 0 ± 1/10, 5.38e-18 at ± 1/20, 1.02e-20 at ± 1/40 (at rounding level)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 7, "ok": true, "cmd": "taylor", "ucas": "taylor sin(x) at 0 order 7", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "taylor", "var": "x", "at": 0, "order": 7, "polynomial": "x - x^3/6 + x^5/120 - x^7/5040", "coefficients": ["0", "1", "0", "-1/6", "0", "1/120", "0", "-1/5040"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "taylor_jet", "points": 8, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "coefficients against long double Taylor-jet arithmetic"}], "files": [], "text": "Maclaurin (Taylor at 0) series of sin(x) at x = 0, through order 7:\n  sin(x) = x - x^3/6 + x^5/120 - x^7/5040 + O(x^8)\n  as x -> 0; coefficients c_k = f^(k)(0)/k!: 0 1 0 -1/6 0 1/120 0 -1/5040\n  check: the coefficients agree with Taylor-jet arithmetic (long double) to 0\n  check: |f - P| = 2.76e-15 at x = 0 ± 1/10, 5.38e-18 at ± 1/20, 1.02e-20 at ± 1/40 (at rounding level)\n"}, "isError": false}}
